          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Pickup is free for qualifying commercial volumes serving Bakersfield businesses, schools, and healthcare sites. Standard scheduled routes have no hidden haul fees, and extra services are quoted in writing first. Complimentary pickup covers qualifying lots across Bakersfield and greater Kern County, including offices, clinics, plants, and campuses. Volume discounts and asset recovery credits may offset recycling costs on reusable equipment after sanitization."
