            "text": "Healthcare IT Managers typically expect detailed certificates of destruction for audit reviews, included in every STS service engagement. Serial-level reporting helps Bakersfield IT teams support internal audits and outside regulator reviews. Certificates name serials, method, and date so finance, IT, and compliance can close each asset record, typically within 48 hours. Chain of custody documentation tracks every asset from pickup through final processing."
