            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We serve Bakersfield from our 200,000 sq ft processing operation, handling office refreshes and data center takeouts. Multi-site pickups for Kern High School District and similar campuses can be staged in the same week. Corporate IT Directors in Bakersfield use the same documented workflow for energy, agribusiness, healthcare, and municipal lots. Same-week scheduling is available for qualifying commercial volumes."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What happens to my equipment after pickup?",
